{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-13","level":"A1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Konjugation der Verben","bn":"Verb-এর রূপ পরিবর্তন"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"du ___ (fahren)","options":["fährst","fahrst","fährt"],"answer":0,"explanation":"fahren অনিয়মিত: du fährst।","id":"a1-practice-13-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"er ___ (lesen)","options":["lesst","liest","lest"],"answer":1,"explanation":"lesen অনিয়মিত: er liest।","id":"a1-practice-13-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie ___ nach Hause. (fahren, সে)","options":["fahrt","fahren","fährt"],"answer":2,"explanation":"sie (সে) → fährt।","id":"a1-practice-13-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ ein Buch. (lesen)","options":["lese","liest","lesen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ich-এর সঙ্গে স্বর বদলায় না: ich lese।","id":"a1-practice-13-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ihr ___ in Dhaka. (wohnen)","options":["wohnen","wohnt","wohnst"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ihr → -t।","id":"a1-practice-13-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Du ___ ein Buch. (lesen)","options":["lest","lesst","liest"],"answer":2,"explanation":"du liest।","id":"a1-practice-13-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir ___ nach Hause. (fahren)","options":["fahren","fährt","fahrt"],"answer":0,"explanation":"wir-এর সঙ্গে স্বর বদলায় না: wir fahren।","id":"a1-practice-13-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ___ Fußball. (spielen)","options":["spiele","spielt","spielst"],"answer":1,"explanation":"er → -t।","id":"a1-practice-13-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Die Wohnung ist möbliert.“ মানে কী?","options":["অ্যাপার্টমেন্টটি খালি।","অ্যাপার্টমেন্টটি অন্ধকার।","অ্যাপার্টমেন্টটি আসবাবপত্রযুক্ত।"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-13-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ihr ___ Zeit.","options":["habt","hat","seid"],"answer":0,"explanation":"haben: ihr habt।","id":"a1-practice-13-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ Student.","options":["ist","bin","habe"],"answer":1,"explanation":"পরিচয় বোঝাতে sein: ich bin।","id":"a1-practice-13-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Das Badezimmer ist dunkel.“ মানে কী?","options":["বাথরুমটি উজ্জ্বল।","বাথরুমটি নতুন।","বাথরুমটি অন্ধকার।"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-13-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„kostenlos“ মানে কী?","options":["বিনামূল্যে","দামি","নতুন"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-13-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Bus fährt um sieben Uhr.“ মানে কী?","options":["বাসটি সাতটা পর্যন্ত থাকে।","বাসটি সাতটায় ছাড়ে।","বাসটি সাত মিনিট পর ছাড়ে।"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-practice-13-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sie hat eine Frage.“ মানে কী?","options":["সে একটি প্রশ্ন খোঁজে।","তার কোনো প্রশ্ন নেই।","তার একটি প্রশ্ন আছে।"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-13-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":9,"vocabulary":8}},"schema":1,"id":"a1-practice-13","level":"A1","test":[]}